<title>USA: SAFECO Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>SAFECO Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	 Q1	   1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.88		    $0.88</p>
<p> Net			111,525		  110,703</p>
<p> Revs		   1,030,191		  982,990</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 126,316		  110,703</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 and 1996 earnings include realized gains from investments, net of taxes. Excluding those gains, Q1 1997 net income was $0.77/shr vs $0.71 in Q1 1996.</p>
</text>
